  "body": "A search by `stringifier\\s+DOMString` in [webref](https://github.com/w3c/webref) says [Selection API](https://w3c.github.io/selection-api/#selection-interface) is the only spec using it in the form of `stringifier DOMString ();`, which is just same as `stringifier;`.\r\n\r\nCloses #816\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\r\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\r\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\r\n\r\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\r\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\r\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\r\n    and remove what's below.\r\n-->\r\n***\r\n<a href=\"https://pr-preview.s3.amazonaws.com/saschanaz/webidl/pull/941.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 22, 2020, 2:36 PM UTC (6d4427a)\">Preview</a> | <a href=\"https://pr-preview.s3.amazonaws.com/heycam/webidl/941/ccef980...saschanaz:6d4427a.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 22, 2020, 2:36 PM UTC (6d4427a)\">Diff</a>",
